description.desc:
When there are <color=#ffffff>[Wind Eyes]</color> on the field, hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to briefly charge, then release to activate:
Throws a hammer dealing <color=#A6C5FD>Wind DMG</color> to enemies on the field;
If there are 3 <color=#ffffff>[Wind Eyes]</color> within the Attack Range, this skill will be released rapidly;
<color=#ffffff>[Wind Eyes]</color> hit by this skill will be detonated, generating tornadoes based on the number of Wind Eyes hit that continuously track enemies and deal <color=#A6C5FD>Wind DMG</color>;
After using this skill, all other <color=#ffffff>[Wind Eyes]</color> not hit will be detonated, but will not generate tornadoes;
During the skill's charge phase, Anti-Interrupt Lv. is increased and <color=#ffffff>[Wind Eyes]</color> on the field are continuously gathered;
During the skill's attack phase, Character is invulnerable.

With enough energy, press or hold <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> to activate: Slide forward, dealing <color=#A6C5FD>Wind DMG</color>;
If you keep holding <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> during the slide, Roxy will spin into a tornado. Drag the joystick to Control the tornado's movement direction. Energy is continuously consumed during this time, dealing <color=#A6C5FD>Wind DMG</color> to enemies in the path. The attack stops when Energy is depleted, or when <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> is released without dragging the joystick;
<color=#ffffff>[Basic Attack]</color> During the third hit, holding <IconMap:Icon_Normal> or <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> can also enter the spin state;
After the slide or spin ends, if <color=#ffffff>[Wind Energy]</color> exists, automatically follows up with <color=#ffffff>[EX Special Attack: Wind Cannon]</color>. If no <color=#ffffff>[Wind Energy]</color> exists, automatically follows up with <color=#ffffff>[Basic Attack: Meteor Hammer]</color>;
Character is invulnerable during the skill attack.

When <color=#ffffff>[EX Special Attack: Ride the Wind]</color> or <color=#ffffff>[EX Special Attack: Ride the Wind]</color> ends and <color=#ffffff>[Wind Energy]</color> exists, automatically activates:
Consumes all <color=#ffffff>[Wind Energy]</color> to fire a wind cannon forward, dealing <color=#A6C5FD>Wind DMG</color>;
For each point of <color=#ffffff>[Wind Energy]</color> consumed, deals an additional instance of <color=#A6C5FD>Wind DMG</color> after the attack and generates 1 <color=#ffffff>[Wind Eye]</color> at the original location;
Character is invulnerable during the skill attack.

desc:
For every 30 Energy consumed, gain 1 <color=#ffffff>[Wind Energy]</color>. <color=#ffffff>[Wind Energy]</color> cap is 3.
When Roxy's initial <color=#ffffff>Energy Regen</color> exceeds <color=#POSITIVE_WITH_GREYITE>1.2</color>, for every <color=#POSITIVE_WITH_GREYITE>0.01</color> beyond that threshold, ATK increases by <color=#POSITIVE_WITH_GREYITE>5</color>, up to a maximum increase of <color=#POSITIVE_WITH_GREYITE>960</color>; Impact increases by <color=#POSITIVE_WITH_GREYITE>3.2</color>, up to a maximum increase of <color=#POSITIVE_WITH_GREYITE>60</color>;
When using <color=#ffffff>[EX Special Attack]</color>, if CRIT Rate is greater than or equal to <color=#POSITIVE_WITH_GREYITE>50</color>%, Anomaly Buildup Rate increases by <color=#POSITIVE_WITH_GREYITE>15</color>%, lasting 50s. Repeated triggers reset the duration;
When <color=#ffffff>[EX Special Attack: Wind Cannon]</color> or <color=#ffffff>[Ultimate: Storm Rampage]</color> hits an enemy affected by <color=#FFFFFF>[Windswept]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[Contamination]</color>, it triggers <color=#FFFFFF>[Cleanse]</color>. <color=#FFFFFF>[Contamination]</color> will be reverted to <color=#FFFFFF>[Windswept]</color>;
<color=#FFFFFF>[Cleanse]</color> can trigger at most once every 16s. For each <color=#FFFFFF>[Wind Eye]</color> generated, the cooldown is reduced by 1s;
<color=#FFFFFF>[Windswept]</color> duration is extended by 1s;
When any teammate in the squad triggers <color=#FFFFFF>[Cleanse]</color>, for every 1% Roxy's CRIT Rate exceeds the threshold, the whole squad's other non-<color=#FFFFFF>[Armorer]</color> Characters gain <color=#POSITIVE_WITH_GREYITE>0.9</color>% CRIT DMG of the cleansed attribute, up to <color=#POSITIVE_WITH_GREYITE>45</color>%; <color=#FFFFFF>[Armorer]</color> Characters gain <color=#POSITIVE_WITH_GREYITE>0.6</color>% CRIT Rate of the cleansed attribute, up to <color=#POSITIVE_WITH_GREYITE>30</color>%. Each attribute buff lasts 50s, and repeated triggers reset the duration.

When another character in your squad is an <color=#FFFFFF>[Attack]</color> Character, <color=#FFFFFF>[Rupture]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[Armorer]</color> Character, the following effects are triggered:
Roxy's CRIT DMG increases by 10%. This effect scales with Character Lv., increasing by 2% per level, up to a maximum increase of 130%;
When any ally hits an enemy, their Daze Vulnerability increases by 30%. When they become Stunned, their Stun duration is extended by 2s;
When an enemy is affected by <color=#FFFFFF>[Windswept]</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>[Contamination]</color>, the <color=#A6C5FD>Wind direct DMG</color> and direct attack DMG that triggers [Contamination] attribute dealt to them is additionally increased by 10%.

